00:00:13.414 --> 00:00:17.151 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Ce matin, elles ont défilé

00:00:14.782 --> 00:00:18.385 size:53% position:73% line:68%
devant le ministère de

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:19.620 size:53% position:73% line:68%
l'Éducation pour réclamer

00:00:17.485 --> 00:00:20.821 size:53% position:73% line:68%
justice et la fin

00:00:18.619 --> 00:00:22.056 size:53% position:73% line:68%
de l'ignorance.

00:00:19.954 --> 00:00:23.290 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Sur leurs banderoles,

00:00:21.155 --> 00:00:24.525 size:53% position:73% line:68%
des références au 15 août,

00:00:22.389 --> 00:00:25.726 size:53% position:73% line:68%
qu'elles qualifient

00:00:23.624 --> 00:00:26.994 size:53% position:73% line:68%
de "jour noir". C'est la date

00:00:24.859 --> 00:00:28.162 size:53% position:73% line:68%
