00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:31.832 size:53% position:73% line:68%
occidentales l'an dernier.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:35.870 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 La réponse des talibans

00:00:30.965 --> 00:00:37.071 size:53% position:73% line:68%
ne se fait pas attendre.

00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:38.305 size:53% position:73% line:68%
(rafale de tirs)

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:39.540 size:53% position:73% line:68%
ne 5 minutes après

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:40.741 size:53% position:73% line:68%
le début de la marche, un groupe

00:00:38.639 --> 00:00:43.677 size:53% position:73% line:68%
